Package: com.local.glassfolderstest3
Name: GlassFolders
Version: 0.7.4~beta4.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Beta 4.5 locks the accepted App Library visual baseline and adds a three-way App Library style selector: Follow Folder, Clear, or Liquid Glass. Follow Folder resolves directly from the normal folder GFStyle while Clear/Liquid can still be forced independently. Existing light/dark/search/category optics remain unchanged.
Maintainer: kulinich
Author: kulinich
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0)
